Improper Input Validation and Handling The service processes uploaded files without explicit validation of file types or contents, which can lead to processing unexpected or malicious files., Resource Management Errors The service may not properly handle resource cleanup, such as closing file streams, which can lead to resource exhaustion or leaks.

